  "definition": "Utilization of Public and Private Insurance",
  "effectiveDate": "2023-09-27",
  "historyNote": "#9594, eff 11-11-09 (from He-M 510.11); ss by #10325, eff 4-26-13 (from He-M 510.15); ss by #13753, eff 9-27-23",
